      "comment": "COLD INTENT (1) stalked the lead and fought on well to finish half a length away in second (22.95) at this track in a Maiden over 390m. Top prospect. CRACKERJACK ASH (3) is racing well without winning, recording three minors on end, the latest hitting the ground running with a fast early sectional but finishing in the minors again when second (22.41) over 390m at this track. Hard to beat again. BLACK SANDS (8) has first look around here after a moderate run last time, finishing fourth at Warragul over 400m behind Buddy Happy (23.47). Cannot be left out. FLYER'S GIRL (4) warrants respect following a recent placing at big odds.",
